// The Witch's House experiment's fourth form, migrated out of the raw 377 cache dump
// (content/scripts/_unpack/377/all.npc) so one field can be corrected. Every line below is the
// untouched raw cache value except size, which the cache does not set at all.
//
// Corey (2026-09-30): "in witches house quest the 4th experiment(wolf) phases through objects".
//
// IT IS NOT A COLLISION BUG. The engine validates every npc step against canTravel before it moves
// (PathingEntity.takeStep), and the whole fight run through the real shed - all four forms, the
// player moved around the room mid-fight - takes zero steps the collision map disallows. What is
// wrong is the wolf's FOOTPRINT: every other npc in the 377 cache built on model1=npc_wolf declares
// size=2 (wolf, whitewolf, whitewolf_sentry, wolfpack_leader, pack_wolf, jungle_wolf, desert_wolf,
// direwolf, viking_wolf, ice_wolf_1-6, vampire_juve_hound - all of them), and shapeshifterwolf alone
// declares none, so it defaults to 1. A 2x2 wolf model standing on a 1x1 tile of collision has three
// quarters of its body outside anything the server is checking, and it walks that body straight
// through the shed's crate, sacks, food trough and walls. Giving it the footprint its own model has
// is the fix.
//
// The other three forms were checked against the same rule and are right as the cache has them, so
// they stay in all.npc: shapeshifterglob is model1=npc_skavid and the plain skavid is size 1;
// shapeshifterspider is model1=poh_giantspider_8 and every giant spider in the cache is size 1; and
// shapeshifterbear already carries size=2, matching brownbear.
//
// The shed is four tiles wide (inzone 0_45_54_54_3 to 0_45_54_57_11 in quest_ball.rs2, x 2934-2937
// by z 3459-3467) and its middle, x 2934-2937 by z 3462-3465, is a clear 4x4 with the spawn coord
// inside it, so a 2x2 wolf has room to fight and to path - the bear, which is already 2x2, has
// always fought there.

[shapeshifterwolf]
name=Witches experiment fourth form
desc=Looks unnatural.
model1=npc_wolf
recol1s=15855
recol1d=9228
recol2s=23254
recol2d=12560
recol3s=15393
recol3d=10219
size=2
walkanim=dog_walk
readyanim=dog_ready
op2=Attack
vislevel=53
hitpoints=51
attack=48
strength=40
defence=49
param=damagetype,^stab_style
param=attack_anim,dog_attack
param=defend_anim,dog_block
param=death_anim,dog_death
param=attack_sound,wolf_attack
param=defend_sound,wolf_hit
param=death_sound,wolf_death
param=death_drop,null
category=witches_experiment
